			"notes": "## Bug Fixes\n\n- **Layout roundtrip**: Fixed export/import — serializer now produces \\[[widget]]\\/\\[[widget.children]]\\ nesting matching the file-based format. \\loadLayout()\\ correctly extracts from \\[[widget]]\\ array.\n- **Dropdown crash**: \\setOptions()\\ now clamps \\selectedIndex\\ to prevent \\IndexOutOfBoundsException\\.\n- **Editor ScrollPanel selection**: Editor can now select/drag widgets inside a scrolled \\ScrollPanel\\.\n- **Null safety**: \\DuckyScreen.getWidget()\\ no longer NPEs with null \\\rootWidget\\.\n- **Misc**: Removed dead variable in \\ScrollPanel.mouseDragged\\; clamped \\PropertyPanel.fieldScroll\\ on resize."
		},
